#. Translators: message asking the user wether NVDA Remote whould be disabled or not
msgid ""
"NVDA Remote has been detected on your NVDA installation. In order for "
"TeleNVDA to work without conflicts, NVDA Remote must be disabled. Otherwise, "
"TeleNVDA will refuse to work. Would you like to disable NVDA Remote now?"
msgstr ""
"NVDA-Remote wurde in Ihrer NVDA-Installation erkannt. Damit TeleNVDA ohne "
"Konflikte funktioniert, muss NVDA-Remote deaktiviert werden. Andernfalls "
"wird TeleNVDA nicht funktionieren. Möchten Sie, dass NVDA-Remote jetzt "
"deaktiviert werden soll?"

#. Translators: question title
msgid "Running NVDA Remote detected"
msgstr "Es wurde das Ausführen von NVDA-Remote erkannt"

msgid "Your NVDA Remote configuration was corrupted and has been reset."
msgstr ""
"Die Konfiguration von NVDA-Remote war beschädigt und wurde zurückgesetzt."

msgid "NVDA Remote Configuration Error"
msgstr "Konfigurationsfehler bei NVDA-Remote"

#. Translators: Item in TeleNVDA submenu to connect to a remote computer.
msgid "Connect..."
msgstr "Verbinden..."

msgid ""
"Remotely connect to another computer running NVDA Remote Access or TeleNVDA"
msgstr ""
"Per Fernzugriff mit einem anderen Computer, auf dem NVDA-Remote oder "
"TeleNVDA läuft, verbinden"

#. Translators: Item in TeleNVDA submenu to disconnect from a remote computer.
msgid "Disconnect"
msgstr "Verbindung &trennen"

msgid "Disconnect from another computer running NVDA Remote Access or TeleNVDA"
msgstr ""
"Die Verbindung zu einem anderen Computer mit NVDA-Remote oder TeleNVDA "
"trennen"

#. Translators: Menu item in TeleNVDA submenu to mute speech and sounds from the remote computer.
msgid "Mute remote"
msgstr "Sprachausgabe auf Remote-Computer stummschalten"

msgid "Mute speech and sounds from the remote computer"
msgstr "Sprachausgabe und Signaltöne auf dem Remote-Computer stummschalten"

#. Translators: Menu item in TeleNVDA submenu to push clipboard content to the remote computer.
msgid "&Push clipboard"
msgstr "Inhalt der &Zwischenablage übertragen"

msgid "Push the clipboard to the other machine"
msgstr "Überträgt den Inhalt der Zwischenablage auf den Remote-Computer"

#. Translators: Menu item in TeleNVDA submenu to send a file to the remote computer.
msgid "Send &file..."
msgstr "Datei &senden..."

msgid "Send a file to the other machine"
msgstr "Senden einer Datei an den Remote-Computer"

#. Translators: Menu item in TeleNVDA submenu to copy a link to the current session compatible with NVDA Remote.
msgid "NVDA &Remote protocol (recommended)"
msgstr "NVDA-Remote-Protokoll (empfohlen)"

msgid ""
"Copy a link to the remote session compatible with both NVDA Remote and "
"TeleNVDA"
msgstr ""
"Einen Link zur Remote-Sitzung kopieren (mit NVDA-Remote als auch mit "
"TeleNVDA kompatibel)"

#. Translators: Menu item in TeleNVDA submenu to copy a link to the current session compatible with TeleNVDA.
msgid "&TeleNVDA protocol"
msgstr "&TeleNVDA-Protokoll"

msgid "Copy a link to the remote session compatible only with TeleNVDA"
msgstr "Einen Link zur Remote-Sitzung kopieren (nur mit TeleNVDA kompatibel)"

#. Translators: Menu item in TeleNVDA submenu to copy a link to the current session.
msgid "Copy &link"
msgstr "Link &kopieren"

msgid "Copy a link to the remote session"
msgstr "Link zur Fernsteuerungssitzung kopieren"

#. Translators: Menu item in TeleNVDA submenu to open add-on options.
msgid "&Options..."
msgstr "&Optionen..."

msgid "Options"
msgstr "Optionen"

#. Translators: Menu item in TeleNVDA submenu to send Control+Alt+Delete to the remote computer.
msgid "Send Ctrl+Alt+Del"
msgstr "Strg+Alt+Entf senden"

#. Translators: Label of menu in NVDA tools menu.
msgid "R&emote"
msgstr "&Fernsteuerung"

#. Translators: question before disconnecting
msgid "Are you sure you want to disconnect the controlled computer?"
msgstr "Möchten Sie wirklich den Remote-Computer abschalten?"

#. Translators: question title
msgid "Warning!"
msgstr "Warnung!"

#. Translators: Menu item in TeleNVDA submenu to unmute speech and sounds from the remote computer.
msgid "Unmute remote"
msgstr "Stummschaltung der Sprachausgabe auf Remote-Computer aufheben"

msgid "Unmute speech and sounds from the remote computer"
msgstr ""
"Aufheben der Stummschaltung der Sprachausgabe und Signaltöne auf dem Remote-"
"Computer"

msgid "Not connected."
msgstr "Nicht verbunden."

#. Translators: message displayed in transfer file dialog when sending a file
msgid "Choose the file you want to send to the remote computer"
msgstr ""
"Wählen Sie die Datei aus, die Sie an den Remote-Computer senden möchten"

#. Translators: supported file types when sending or receiving files
msgid "All files (*.*)"
msgstr "Alle Dateien (*.*)"

#. Translators: error message when a file is too big
msgid "This file is too large. Only files smaller than 10 MB are supported."
msgstr ""
"Diese Datei ist zu groß. Nur Dateien bis zur Größe von 10 MB sind erlaubt."

#. Translators: error message caption
msgid "Error"
msgstr "Fehler"

#. Translators: question before sending a file
msgid ""
"The session will be blocked until the transfer is complete. Are you sure you "
"want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Die Sitzung wird blockiert, bis die Übertragung abgeschlossen ist. Möchten "
"Sie fortfahren?"

#. Translators: message spoken when the file has been sent successfully
msgid "File sent"
msgstr "Datei gesendet"

#. Translators: report number of connected computers gesture description
msgid "Reports number of computers connected to a session"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: message reported when get number of clients gesture is pressed
msgid "This is the only computer connected to this session"
msgid_plural "There are {} computers connected to this session"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#. Translators: send file gesture description
msgid "Sends the specified file to the remote machine"
msgstr "Sendet die angegebene Datei an den Remote-Computer"

#. Translators: push clipboard gesture description
msgid "Sends the contents of the clipboard to the remote machine"
msgstr "Überträgt den Inhalt der Zwischenablage an den entfernten Rechner"

msgid "Clipboard pushed"
msgstr "Inhalt der Zwischenablage übertragen"

msgid "Unable to push clipboard"
msgstr "Fehler beim Übertragen des Inhalts der Zwischenablage"

#. Translators: message spoken when the Ctrl+Alt+Delete has been sent to the remote machine successfully
msgid "Ctrl+Alt+Delete has been sent to the remote machine"
msgstr ""
"Die Tastenkombination Strg+Alt+Entf wurde an den Remote-Computer gesendet"

#. Translators: Presented when disconnected from the remote computer.
msgid "Disconnected!"
msgstr "Verbindung getrennt!"

#. Translators: Title of the connection error dialog.
msgid "Error Connecting"
msgstr "Fehler beim Verbindungsaufbau"

#. Translators: Message shown when cannot connect to the remote computer.
msgid "Unable to connect to the remote computer"
msgstr "Die Verbindung zum Remote-Computer konnte nicht hergestellt werden"

#. Translators: Title of the connect dialog.
msgid "Connect"
msgstr "Verbinden"

#. Translators: Presented when connected to the remote computer.
msgid "Connected!"
msgstr "Verbunden!"

#. Translators: Presented when connection to a remote computer was interupted.
msgid "Connection interrupted"
msgstr "Verbindung unterbrochen"

#. Translators: A message to warn the user that handle keys from other applications should be on.
msgid ""
"The option to handle keys from other applications is disabled in your NVDA "
"keyboard settings. In order to allow the keyboard of this machine to be "
"controlled, this option should be enabled. Would you like to do this now?"
msgstr ""
"Die Option zur Verarbeitung von Tasten aus anderen Anwendungen ist in den "
"NVDA-Tastatur-Einstellungen deaktiviert. Damit die Tastatur dieses Computers "
"gesteuert werden kann, sollte diese Option aktiviert werden. Soll dies jetzt "
"geändert werden?"

#. Translators: The title of the warning dialog displayed when handle keys from other applications is disabled.
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Warnung"

#. Translators: Presented in direct (client to server) remote connection when the controlled computer is ready.
msgid "Connected to control server"
msgstr "Mit dem Kontroll-Server verbunden"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Do you wish to control the machine on server {server} with key {key}?"
msgstr ""
"Möchten Sie den Rechner auf dem Server {server} mit dem Schlüssel {key} "
"steuern?"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Do you wish to allow this machine to be controlled on server {server} with "
"key {key}?"
msgstr ""
"Möchten Sie die Steuerung dieses Rechners über den Server {server} mit dem "
"Schlüssel {key} erlauben?"

#. Translators: Copy link compatible with NVDA Remote gesture description
msgid ""
"Copies a link to the remote session to the clipboard compatible with both "
"NVDA Remote and TeleNVDA"
msgstr ""
"Kopiert einen Link zur Remote-Sitzung in die Zwischenablage (kompatibel mit "
"NVDA-Remote und TeleNVDA)"

msgid "Copied link"
msgstr "Link kopiert"

#. Translators: Copy link compatible with TeleNVDA gesture description
msgid ""
"Copies a link to the remote session to the clipboard compatible only with "
"TeleNVDA"
msgstr ""
"Kopiert einen Link zur Remote-Sitzung in die Zwischenablage (nur kompatibel "
"mit TeleNVDA)"

#. Translators: description for the Connect gesture
msgid "Opens a dialog to start a remote session"
msgstr "Öffnet ein Dialogfeld zum Starten einer Remote-Sitzung"

#. Translators: description for the Disconnect gesture
msgid "Disconnect a remote session"
msgstr "Remote-Sitzung trennen"

#. Translators: gesture description for the ignoreNextGesture script
msgid ""
"Set the host to ignore the next gesture completely, sending next gesture to "
"the guest as is. Useful when you need to use the gesture asigned to toggle "
"between guest and host, in the guest machine."
msgstr ""
"Legt fest, dass der Host den nächsten Tastenbefehl vollständig ignoriert und "
"den nächsten Tastenbefehl unverändert an den Remote-Computer sendet. "
"Nützlich, wenn Sie den zugewiesenen Tastenbefehl verwenden müssen, um "
"zwischen Host und Remote-Computer auf dem Remote-Computer umzuschalten."

#. Translators: Report when the next gesture will be send to the guest ignoring everything else.
msgid "Send next gesture to the guest"
msgstr "Nächsten Tastenbefehl an den Remote-Computer senden"

#. Translators: Documentation string for the script that toggles the control between guest and host machine.
msgid "Toggles the control between guest and host machine"
msgstr "Schaltet die Kontrolle zwischen Remote- und Host-Computer um"

#. Translators: Presented when sending keyboard keys from the controlling computer to the controlled computer.
msgid "Controlling remote machine."
msgstr "Steuerung des Remote-Computers."

#. Translators: Presented when keyboard control is back to the controlling computer.
msgid "Controlling local machine."
msgstr "Steuerung des lokalen Computers."

#. Translators: gesture description for the toggle remote mute script
msgid "Mute or unmute the speech coming from the remote computer"
msgstr "Schaltet die Sprachausgabe auf dem Remote-Computer ein oder aus"

#. Translators: send Ctrl+Alt+Delete gesture description
msgid "Sends Ctrl+Alt+Delete to the remote machine"
msgstr "Sendet die Tastenkombination Strg+Alt+Entf an den Remote-Computer"

#. Translators: open addon settings gesture description
msgid "Opens the addon settings panel inside NVDA settings dialog"
msgstr "Öffnet die Einstellungen in NVDA"

#. Translators: The label of an edit field in connect dialog to enter name or address of the remote computer.
msgid "&Host:"
msgstr "&Host:"

#. Translators: Label of the edit field to enter key (password) to secure the remote connection.
msgid "&Key:"
msgstr "&Schlüssel:"

#. Translators: The button used to generate a random key/password.
msgid "&Generate Key"
msgstr "Schlüssel &generieren"

msgid "Host must be set."
msgstr "Der Host muss festgelegt sein."

#. Translators: Used in server mode to obtain the external IP address for the server (controlled computer) for direct connection.
msgid "Get External &IP"
msgstr "Externe &IP-Adresse ermitteln"

#. Translators: Label of the field displaying the external IP address if using direct (client to server) connection.
msgid "&External IP:"
msgstr "&Externe IP-Adresse:"

#. Translators: The label of an edit field in connect dialog to enter the port the server will listen on.
msgid "&Port:"
msgstr "&Port:"

#. Translators: label of a checkbox which allows forwarding a port using UPNP
msgid "Use &UPNP to forward this port if possible"
msgstr "&UPnP für Port-Weiterleitungen verwenden, falls möglich"

#. Translators: message asking the user wether perform portcheck with UPNP or not
msgid ""
"Would you like to use UPNP to forward the chosen port before detecting your "
"IP address?"
msgstr ""
"Möchten Sie UPnP noch vor der Erkennung Ihrer IP-Adresse verwenden, um den "
"ausgewählten Port weiterzuleiten?"

#. Translators: title of the message asking the user to try portcheck with UPNP
msgid "Do you want to use UPNP?"
msgstr "Möchten Sie UPnP verwenden?"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Successfully retrieved IP address. Port {port} is open."
msgstr "Die IP-Adresse wurde erfolgreich abgerufen. Der Port {port} ist offen."

msgid "Success"
msgstr "Erfolg"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Retrieved external IP, but port {port} is not currently forwarded."
msgstr ""
"Externe IP-Adresse abgerufen, aber es besteht über den Port {port} derzeit "
"keine Weiterleitung."

msgid ""
"Unable to contact portcheck server or UPNP device, please manually retrieve "
"your IP address and forward ports if required. See the NVDA log for more "
"details."
msgstr ""
"Der Server für den Port-Check oder das UPnP-Gerät war nicht erreichbar. "
"Bitte rufen Sie Ihre IP-Adresse manuell ab und leiten Sie bei Bedarf die "
"Ports weiter. Im NVDA-Protokoll finden Sie dazu weitere Einzelheiten."

msgid "Client"
msgstr "Client"

msgid "Server"
msgstr "Server"

msgid "Control another machine"
msgstr "Einen anderen Computer steuern"

msgid "Allow this machine to be controlled"
msgstr "Steuerung dieses Computers zulassen"

msgid "Both host and key must be set."
msgstr "Sowohl Host als auch Schlüssel sollten festgelegt werden."

#. Translators: error message for key/password length less than 6 characters
msgid "The key must be longer than 6 characters."
msgstr ""

#. Translators: error message for key/password being sequential, example 123456
msgid ""
"The key must not be sequential. Please, avoid keys such as 1234, 4321 or "
"similar."
msgstr ""

msgid "Both port and key must be set."
msgstr "Sowohl Port als auch Schlüssel sollte festgelegt werden."

#. Translators: A checkbox in add-on options dialog to set whether remote server is started when NVDA starts.
msgid "Auto-connect to control server on startup"
msgstr "Beim Start automatisch mit Server verbinden"

#. Translators: Whether or not to use a relay server when autoconnecting
msgid "Use Remote Control Server"
msgstr "Server für Remote-Verbindung verwenden"

msgid "Host Control Server"
msgstr "Kontroll-Server bereitstellen"

#. Translators: A checkbox in add-on options dialog to set whether sounds play instead of beeps.
msgid "Play sounds instead of beeps"
msgstr "Sounds statt Signaltöne wiedergeben"

#. Translators: A checkbox in add-on options dialog to set whether to display an alert before the controlled computer disconnects.
msgid "Display an alert before the controlled computer disconnects"
msgstr ""
"Eine Warnung anzeigen, bevor die Verbindung zum Remote-Computer unterbrochen "
"wird"

#. Translators: A checkbox in add-on options dialog to set whether to mute remote speech when controlling the local machine.
msgid "Mute remote speech when controlling local machine"
msgstr ""
"Sprachausgabe während der Remote-Verbindung auf dem eigenen Computer "
"stummschalten"

#. Translators: A checkbox in add-on options dialog to set whether allow or block speech commands
msgid "Process speech commands when controlling another computer"
msgstr ""
"Befehlsverarbeitung der Sprachausgabe bei der Steuerung eines anderen "
"Computers"

#. Translators: A checkbox in add-on options dialog to set whether server welcome messages are displayed only once
msgid "Show server welcome messages only once"
msgstr ""

#. Translators: a text field in add-on options dialog to set the portcheck service URL
msgid "Portcheck &service URL: "
msgstr "&Service-URL für Port-Check: "

#. Translators: A button in add-on options dialog to delete all fingerprints of unauthorized certificates.
msgid "Delete all trusted fingerprints"
msgstr "Alle vertrauenswürdigen Fingerprints entfernen"

msgid ""
"When connecting to an unauthorized server, you will again be prompted to "
"accepts its certificate."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Sie eine Verbindung zu einem nicht autorisierten Server herstellen, "
"werden Sie erneut aufgefordert, dessen Zertifikat zu akzeptieren."

msgid "Are you sure you want to delete all stored trusted fingerprints?"
msgstr ""
"Möchten Sie wirklich alle gespeicherten vertrauenswürdigen Fingerprints "
"entfernen?"

#. Translators: error message for invalid format on Portcheck service URL
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Invalid format for portcheck service URL. You must include {port} somewhere."
msgstr "Ungültiges Format für die Service-URL des Port-Checks: {port} fehlt."

#. Translators: A message of a window presented when an attempt has been made to connect with a server with unauthorized certificate.
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Warning! The certificate of this server could not be verified.\n"
"This connection may not be secure. It is possible that someone is trying to "
"overhear your communication.\n"
"Before continuing please make sure that the following server certificate "
"fingerprint is a proper one.\n"
"If you have any questions, please contact the server administrator.\n"
"\n"
"Server SHA256 fingerprint: {fingerprint}\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue connecting?"
msgstr ""
"Warnung! Das Zertifikat dieses Servers konnte nicht überprüft werden.\n"
"Diese Verbindung ist möglicherweise nicht sicher. Es ist möglich, dass "
"jemand versucht, Ihre Kommunikation zu belauschen.\n"
"Bevor Sie fortfahren, vergewissern Sie sich bitte, dass der Fingerprint des "
"folgenden Serverzertifikats korrekt ist.\n"
"Wenn Sie Fragen haben, wenden Sie sich bitte an den Server-Administrator.\n"
"\n"
"Server-SHA256-Fingerprint: {fingerprint}\n"
"\n"
"Soll die Verbindung fortgesetzt werden?"

msgid "Connect and do not ask again for this server"
msgstr "Verbinden und nicht mehr nach diesem Server fragen"

msgid "Clipboard updated"
msgstr "Inhalt der Zwischenablage aktualisiert"

#. Translators: Sent when a user fails to send CTRL+ALT+DEL from a remote NVDA instance
msgid "No permission on device to trigger CTRL+ALT+DEL from remote"
msgstr ""
"Keine Berechtigung auf dem Remote-Computer zum Auslösen von Strg+Alt+Entf"

#. Translators: message displayed in transfer file dialog when receiving a file
msgid "Choose where to save the received file"
msgstr "Wählen Sie aus, wo die empfangene Datei gespeichert werden soll"

#. Translators: message spoken when the file has been received successfully
msgid "File received"
msgstr "Datei empfangen"

#. translators: Message for version mismatch
msgid ""
"The version of the relay server which you have connected to is not "
"compatible with this version of the Remote Client.\n"
"Please either use a different server or upgrade your version of the addon."
msgstr ""
"Die Version des Relay-Servers, mit dem Sie sich verbunden haben, ist nicht "
"mit dieser Version des Remote Client kompatibel.\n"
"Bitte verwenden Sie entweder einen anderen Server oder aktualisieren Sie die "
"Version der NVDA-Erweiterung."

msgid "Message of the Day"
msgstr "Nachricht des Tages"

msgid "Remote NVDA not connected."
msgstr "Nicht mit NVDA auf dem Remote-Computer verbunden."

msgid "Invalid URL"
msgstr "Ungültige URL"

#. Translators: Message shown when an invalid URL has been provided.
#, python-format
msgid "Unable to parse url \"%s\""
msgstr "Die Url \"%s\" konnte nicht geparst werden"

#~ msgid "Remote Support"
#~ msgstr "Unterstützung von Fernsteuerung"

#~ msgid "NVDA Remote"
#~ msgstr "Fernsteuerung für NVDA"

#~ msgid "NVDA Remote Access"
#~ msgstr "Fernsteuerung für NVDA"

#. Translators: script category for add-on gestures; also the settings category and tools menu name
msgid "remremote"
msgstr "remremote"

#. Translators: caption when the add-on is already connected
msgid "remremote Already Connected"
msgstr "remremote ist bereits verbunden"

#. Translators: message when trying to open a new connection while connected
msgid "remremote is already connected. Disconnect before opening a new connection."
msgstr "remremote ist bereits verbunden. Trennen Sie die Verbindung, bevor Sie eine neue aufbauen."

#. Translators: title of the connection request dialog
msgid "remremote Connection Request"
msgstr "remremote-Verbindungsanfrage"

#. Translators: title of the certificate security warning dialog
msgid "remremote Connection Security Warning"
msgstr "Sicherheitswarnung über die remremote-Verbindung"

#. Translators: Summary for this add-on to be shown on installation and add-on information.
msgid "remremote remote assistance"
msgstr "remremote-Fernunterstützung"

#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-ons manager
msgid "Allows remote control of and remote access to another machine, including streaming the remote computer's audio. remremote is a fork of TeleNVDA, which itself is based on NVDA Remote."
msgstr "Ermöglicht die Fernsteuerung von und den Fernzugriff auf einen anderen Computer, einschließlich der Übertragung des Tons des entfernten Computers. remremote ist ein Fork von TeleNVDA, das wiederum auf NVDA Remote basiert."

#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
msgid "First remremote release: stream the remote computer's audio from either end (control+shift+NVDA+a), optionally hearing that computer's own speech synthesizer instead of its text speech (control+shift+NVDA+s), keep both clipboards in sync (control+shift+NVDA+k), UPnP port forwarding for both TCP and UDP with a confirmation prompt, and guided installation of the .NET 10 Desktop Runtime when it is missing. Also fixes the add-on staying unreachable inside UAC prompts and other secure desktops."
msgstr "Erste remremote-Version: Überträgt den Ton des entfernten Computers von beiden Seiten aus (Strg+Umschalt+NVDA+a), auf Wunsch mit der eigenen Sprachausgabe jenes Computers anstelle seiner Textsprache (Strg+Umschalt+NVDA+s), hält die Zwischenablagen beider Computer synchron (Strg+Umschalt+NVDA+k), UPnP-Portweiterleitung für TCP und UDP mit Rückfrage sowie geführte Installation der .NET 10 Desktop Runtime, falls sie fehlt. Behebt außerdem, dass das Add-on in UAC-Dialogen und anderen geschützten Desktops nicht erreichbar war."

#. Translators: gesture description for the toggle remote audio script
msgid "Turn streaming of the controlled computer's audio on or off"
msgstr "Übertragung des Tons des gesteuerten Computers ein- oder ausschalten"

#. Translators: reported when the user requests audio streaming from the remote computer.
msgid "Requesting remote audio..."
msgstr "Remote-Audio wird angefordert..."

#. Translators: reported when remote audio streaming has been turned on.
msgid "Remote audio on"
msgstr "Remote-Audio ein"

#. Translators: reported when remote audio streaming has been turned off.
msgid "Remote audio off"
msgstr "Remote-Audio aus"

#. Translators: reported when the controlled computer never answered the audio request.
msgid "No response. The remote computer may not support audio streaming (remremote required on both ends)."
msgstr "Keine Antwort. Der entfernte Computer unterstützt möglicherweise keine Audioübertragung (remremote wird auf beiden Seiten benötigt)."

#. Translators: reported when audio streaming was requested over a relayed connection.
msgid "Audio streaming is not available over relay connections yet. Use a direct connection (control server)."
msgstr "Audioübertragung ist über Relay-Verbindungen noch nicht verfügbar. Verwenden Sie eine Direktverbindung (Kontrollserver)."

#. Translators: reported when the remote computer lacks the .NET runtime for audio streaming.
msgid "The remote computer cannot stream audio: the .NET 10 Desktop Runtime is missing there."
msgstr "Der entfernte Computer kann kein Audio übertragen: Dort fehlt die .NET 10 Desktop Runtime."

#. Translators: reported when the remote computer failed to start audio streaming; {reason} is an error code.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The remote computer could not start audio streaming ({reason})."
msgstr "Der entfernte Computer konnte die Audioübertragung nicht starten ({reason})."

#. Translators: reported on the controlled computer when audio streaming starts.
msgid "Streaming audio to the controlling computer"
msgstr "Audio wird zum steuernden Computer übertragen"

#. Translators: reported on the controlled computer when the controller stopped audio streaming.
msgid "Stopped streaming audio to the controlling computer"
msgstr "Audioübertragung zum steuernden Computer beendet"

#. Translators: reported on the controlled computer when it offers its audio to the controller.
msgid "Offering audio to the controlling computer..."
msgstr "Audio wird dem steuernden Computer angeboten..."

#. Translators: reported on the controlled computer when the controller never answered the audio offer.
msgid "No response. The controlling computer may not support audio streaming (remremote required on both ends)."
msgstr "Keine Antwort. Der steuernde Computer unterstützt möglicherweise keine Audioübertragung (remremote wird auf beiden Seiten benötigt)."

#. Translators: reported when the audio offer could not be sent to the controlling computer.
msgid "Could not offer the audio to the controlling computer."
msgstr "Das Audio konnte dem steuernden Computer nicht angeboten werden."

#. Translators: reported when audio streaming is toggled from a secure desktop (e.g. a UAC prompt).
msgid "Audio streaming can only be switched from the normal desktop."
msgstr "Die Audioübertragung kann nur vom normalen Desktop aus umgeschaltet werden."

#. Translators: reported when the controlled computer stopped sharing its audio.
msgid "The remote computer stopped sharing its audio"
msgstr "Der entfernte Computer überträgt seinen Ton nicht mehr"

#. Translators: reported on the controlled computer when NVDA's audio cannot be excluded from the stream.
msgid "Warning: NVDA's own audio cannot be excluded from the stream on this version of Windows."
msgstr "Warnung: NVDAs eigener Ton kann unter dieser Windows-Version nicht von der Übertragung ausgeschlossen werden."

#. Translators: reported when the local audio helper reports an error; {error} is its message.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Audio error: {error}"
msgstr "Audiofehler: {error}"

#. Translators: reported when the audio helper process died while streaming.
msgid "Audio streaming stopped unexpectedly"
msgstr "Die Audioübertragung wurde unerwartet beendet"

#. Translators: reported when the local audio receiver could not be started.
msgid "Could not start the audio receiver. See the NVDA log for details."
msgstr "Der Audioempfänger konnte nicht gestartet werden. Details finden Sie im NVDA-Protokoll."

#. Translators: question asked at NVDA startup when the .NET runtime for audio streaming is missing.
msgid "remremote's audio streaming needs the .NET 10 Desktop Runtime, which is not installed on this computer. Do you want to install it now? If you choose no, you won't be asked at startup again, but audio streaming will offer the installation when used."
msgstr "Die Audioübertragung von remremote benötigt die .NET 10 Desktop Runtime, die auf diesem Computer nicht installiert ist. Möchten Sie sie jetzt installieren? Wenn Sie Nein wählen, werden Sie beim Start nicht erneut gefragt; bei Verwendung der Audioübertragung wird die Installation aber wieder angeboten."

#. Translators: title of the missing runtime question.
msgid "Audio streaming component missing"
msgstr "Komponente für die Audioübertragung fehlt"

#. Translators: question asked when audio streaming failed because the .NET runtime is missing.
msgid "Audio streaming needs the .NET 10 Desktop Runtime, which is not installed. Do you want to install it now?"
msgstr "Die Audioübertragung benötigt die .NET 10 Desktop Runtime, die nicht installiert ist. Möchten Sie sie jetzt installieren?"

#. Translators: reported when the runtime installation is still in progress.
msgid "The .NET runtime installation is still running. Please wait."
msgstr "Die Installation der .NET-Runtime läuft noch. Bitte warten."

#. Translators: reported while the .NET runtime is being installed in the background.
msgid "Installing the .NET 10 Desktop Runtime in the background. You may see a User Account Control prompt — please confirm it. You will be notified when the installation finishes."
msgstr "Die .NET 10 Desktop Runtime wird im Hintergrund installiert. Möglicherweise erscheint eine Abfrage der Benutzerkontensteuerung — bitte bestätigen Sie diese. Sie werden benachrichtigt, sobald die Installation abgeschlossen ist."

#. Translators: reported when the .NET runtime finished installing.
msgid "The .NET 10 Desktop Runtime has been installed. You can use audio streaming now."
msgstr "Die .NET 10 Desktop Runtime wurde installiert. Sie können die Audioübertragung jetzt verwenden."

#. Translators: reported when the runtime install finished but couldn't be verified.
msgid "The runtime installation finished. If audio streaming still fails, please restart the computer."
msgstr "Die Installation der Runtime ist abgeschlossen. Falls die Audioübertragung weiterhin fehlschlägt, starten Sie bitte den Computer neu."

#. Translators: reported when automatic runtime installation failed and the download page was opened instead.
msgid "Automatic installation did not work. The .NET 10 Desktop Runtime download has been started in your browser — please run the downloaded installer manually."
msgstr "Die automatische Installation hat nicht funktioniert. Der Download der .NET 10 Desktop Runtime wurde in Ihrem Browser gestartet — bitte führen Sie das heruntergeladene Installationsprogramm manuell aus."

#. Translators: question asked before starting a control server, offering to forward the port automatically.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "remremote can try to automatically forward port {port} in your router using UPnP: TCP for the control connection and UDP for remote audio streaming. Do you want to do this now?"
msgstr "remremote kann versuchen, Port {port} in Ihrem Router automatisch per UPnP freizugeben: TCP für die Steuerverbindung und UDP für die Audioübertragung. Möchten Sie das jetzt tun?"

#. Translators: title of the automatic port forwarding question.
msgid "Automatic port forwarding"
msgstr "Automatische Portweiterleitung"

#. Translators: question asked the first time the user hosts a control server, offering to add firewall exceptions.
msgid "Since you are hosting a control server for the first time: should remremote add itself to the Windows Firewall exceptions, so that incoming control and audio connections are not blocked? This may trigger a User Account Control prompt which you will need to confirm."
msgstr "Da Sie zum ersten Mal einen Kontrollserver hosten: Soll sich remremote zu den Ausnahmen der Windows-Firewall hinzufügen, damit eingehende Steuer- und Audioverbindungen nicht blockiert werden? Dies kann eine Abfrage der Benutzerkontensteuerung auslösen, die Sie bestätigen müssen."

#. Translators: title of the firewall exception question.
msgid "Windows Firewall"
msgstr "Windows-Firewall"

#. Translators: reported after requesting the firewall exceptions.
msgid "Firewall exceptions requested. Please confirm the User Account Control prompt if it appears."
msgstr "Firewall-Ausnahmen wurden angefordert. Bitte bestätigen Sie die Abfrage der Benutzerkontensteuerung, falls sie erscheint."

#. Translators: reported when the firewall exceptions could not be added.
msgid "Could not add the firewall exceptions. You can add NVDA and the audio helper to the Windows Firewall manually."
msgstr "Die Firewall-Ausnahmen konnten nicht hinzugefügt werden. Sie können NVDA und den Audio-Helfer manuell zur Windows-Firewall hinzufügen."

#. Translators: gesture description for the repair firewall exceptions script
msgid "Adds or repairs the Windows Firewall exceptions for remremote"
msgstr "Fügt die Ausnahmen für remremote in der Windows-Firewall hinzu oder repariert sie"

#. Translators: Menu item in remremote submenu to create Windows Firewall rules for the control server hosted on this computer.
msgid "Create firewall &rules for the control server (User Account Control may be required)"
msgstr "Firewall-&Regeln für den Kontrollserver erstellen (möglicherweise ist die Benutzerkontensteuerung erforderlich)"

#. Translators: description of the firewall rules menu item
msgid "Allow incoming connections to the control server hosted on this computer through the Windows Firewall"
msgstr "Eingehende Verbindungen zum auf diesem Computer gehosteten Kontrollserver in der Windows-Firewall zulassen"

#. Translators: reported when firewall rules are requested while not hosting a control server.
msgid "No control server is running on this computer."
msgstr "Auf diesem Computer läuft kein Kontrollserver."

#. Translators: Checkable menu item in remremote submenu to stream the remote computer's audio.
msgid "Stream remote &audio"
msgstr "Entfernten &Ton übertragen"

#. Translators: description of the remote audio menu item
msgid "Play the audio of the remote computer on this computer"
msgstr "Den Ton des entfernten Computers auf diesem Computer wiedergeben"

#. Translators: Checkable menu item in remremote submenu, on the controlled computer, to share its audio.
msgid "Stream &audio to the controlling computer"
msgstr "&Ton zum steuernden Computer übertragen"

#. Translators: description of the audio menu item on the controlled computer.
msgid "Play the audio of this computer on the controlling computer"
msgstr "Den Ton dieses Computers auf dem steuernden Computer wiedergeben"

#. Translators: Checkable menu item in remremote submenu to keep both clipboards synchronised.
msgid "&Keep clipboard in sync"
msgstr "Zwischenablage synchron &halten"

#. Translators: description of the clipboard sync menu item
msgid "Automatically keep the clipboards of both computers identical (text only)"
msgstr "Die Zwischenablagen beider Computer automatisch identisch halten (nur Text)"

#. Translators: gesture description for the clipboard sync toggle
msgid "Turn synchronisation of both computers' clipboards on or off"
msgstr "Die Synchronisierung der Zwischenablagen beider Computer ein- oder ausschalten"

#. Translators: reported when clipboard sync has been turned on.
msgid "Clipboard sync on"
msgstr "Zwischenablage-Synchronisierung ein"

#. Translators: reported when clipboard sync has been turned off.
msgid "Clipboard sync off"
msgstr "Zwischenablage-Synchronisierung aus"

#. Translators: reported when the other computer turned clipboard sync on.
msgid "Clipboard sync turned on by the other computer"
msgstr "Zwischenablage-Synchronisierung vom anderen Computer eingeschaltet"

#. Translators: reported when the other computer turned clipboard sync off.
msgid "Clipboard sync turned off by the other computer"
msgstr "Zwischenablage-Synchronisierung vom anderen Computer ausgeschaltet"

#. Translators: reported when the clipboard could not be monitored.
msgid "Could not monitor the clipboard on this computer."
msgstr "Die Zwischenablage konnte auf diesem Computer nicht überwacht werden."

#. Translators: reported when the control server could not be started; {port} is the port number.
msgid ""
"Could not start the control server on port {port}. Another program — or "
"another copy of NVDA — may already be using it."
msgstr ""
"Der Kontrollserver konnte auf Port {port} nicht gestartet werden. "
"Möglicherweise verwendet ihn bereits ein anderes Programm oder eine andere "
"NVDA-Instanz."

#. Translators: reported when the remote speech setting could not be sent to the controlling computer.
msgid "Could not reach the controlling computer."
msgstr "Der kontrollierende Computer konnte nicht erreicht werden."

#. Translators: reported when the controlled computer turned on using its own synthesizer.
msgid "Remote speech synthesizer turned on by the other computer"
msgstr "Sprachausgabe des entfernten Computers vom anderen Computer eingeschaltet"

#. Translators: reported when the controlled computer turned off using its own synthesizer.
msgid "Remote speech synthesizer turned off by the other computer"
msgstr "Sprachausgabe des entfernten Computers vom anderen Computer ausgeschaltet"

#. Translators: reported when using the remote computer's own synthesizer is turned on.
msgid "Remote speech synthesizer on"
msgstr "Sprachausgabe des entfernten Computers ein"

#. Translators: reported when using the remote computer's own synthesizer is turned off.
msgid "Remote speech synthesizer off"
msgstr "Sprachausgabe des entfernten Computers aus"

#. Translators: reported when remote audio streaming started using the remote computer's own synthesizer.
msgid "Remote audio on, using the remote computer's speech synthesizer"
msgstr "Ton des entfernten Computers ein, mit dessen eigener Sprachausgabe"

#. Translators: reported when the remote computer cannot use its own synthesizer for the stream.
msgid "Remote audio on. The remote computer cannot use its own speech synthesizer, so its speech still arrives as text."
msgstr "Ton des entfernten Computers ein. Der entfernte Computer kann seine eigene Sprachausgabe nicht verwenden, seine Sprache kommt weiterhin als Text an."

#. Translators: reported on the controlled computer when it starts streaming with its own speech.
msgid "Streaming audio to the controlling computer, including this computer's speech"
msgstr "Ton wird zum kontrollierenden Computer übertragen, einschließlich der Sprachausgabe dieses Computers"

#. Translators: Label of an edit field to enter a second password to exchange encrypted data.
msgid "En&cryption password (optional):"
msgstr "Vers&chlüsselungskennwort (optional):"

#. Translators: A checkbox in add-on options dialog to use the remote computer's own synthesizer while its audio is streamed.
msgid "Use the &speech synthesizer of the remote computer while its audio is streamed"
msgstr "Bei Tonübertragung die &Sprachausgabe des entfernten Computers verwenden"

#. Translators: gesture description for the remote speech synthesizer toggle
msgid "Turn using the speech synthesizer of the remote computer during audio streaming on or off"
msgstr "Verwendung der Sprachausgabe des entfernten Computers bei Tonübertragung ein- oder ausschalten"
